`,s.jsxs(e.li,{children:["The largest logit is the first signal to cross its threshold, at step ",S.logitCrossStep,", while the loss is still falling and more than 100 steps before it stalls. The gradient norm crosses only at step ",S.gradCrossStep,", after the stall. The spike score never crosses: it flags a sudden jump in the loss, and this loss levels off without one."]}),`
