`,s.jsx(e.li,{children:"The healthy AdamW runs stay under both thresholds, but with a small margin on the gradient norm, which peaks during the warmup. Every healthy Muon seed crosses the gradient-norm threshold during the warmup, while its logit stays low. A gradient-norm threshold chosen on AdamW runs raises alarms on a healthy Muon run, while the logit threshold holds for both."}),`
